WEBVTT

00:15:57.415 --> 00:16:01.276
Pitajte me što nisam učinio.

00:16:01.276 --> 00:16:06.533
Nisam joj podrezao krila, to je sve.

00:16:06.533 --> 00:16:09.415
Hvala vam puno.

00:16:09.415 --> 00:16:12.705
(Pljesak)

00:16:15.995 --> 00:16:19.287
Hvala vam. Hvala vam puno. Hvala vam. (Pljesak)